# engine takes the recommended option, which need not be the first. It ends
# in Orgrimmar's Valley of Strength, a few steps from where the Silverpine
# guide starts (its first located goal, the Orgrimmar flight master) and a
# ride from the Barrens guide's start at Razor Hill: on one continent, so the
# choice turns on the walk itself, not on pricing a zeppelin crossing.
